        "collapsible_row_Mp7Zcr": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is organic cotton?",
            "heading_size": "h5",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>It's cotton grown without synthetic pesticides, herbicides, or genetically modified seeds — using methods that are gentler on the soil, water, and the people who grow it.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Qs4Tnw": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is GOTS certification?",
            "heading_size": "h5",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>GOTS (Global Organic Textile Standard) is an international standard confirming that a textile is made from certified organic raw materials and produced responsibly and ethically at every stage — from farming to the finished garment — without toxic dyes or harmful chemicals, and under fair labour conditions. Compliance is verified through an independent annual audit.</p>",
            "page": ""
